/// * `compilerOptions.rootDirs` (if specifier starts with `.`)
/// * `compilerOptions.baseUrl` (if specifier does not start with `.`)
// <https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/blob/v5.9.3/src/compiler/moduleNameResolver.ts#L1550>
